function Photo({property,index=0}:{property:Property;index?:number}){const [failed,setFailed]=useState(false);useEffect(()=>setFailed(false),[property.id,index]);return failed||!property.photos[index]?<div className="photo-fallback"><Home/><span>Photo unavailable</span></div>:<img src={property.photos[index]} alt={property.source!=='sample'?`Listing photo ${index+1} of ${property.address}`:`Illustrative photo for ${property.address}`} loading="lazy" onError={()=>setFailed(true)}/>;}
function useVisibleEvent(ref:{current:HTMLElement|null},key:string,callback:()=>void,requirePhoto=false){
 const latest=useRef(callback);latest.current=callback;
 useEffect(()=>{const element=ref.current;if(!element)return;let visible=false,done=false,timer:ReturnType<typeof setTimeout>|undefined;
  const schedule=()=>{clearTimeout(timer);if(done||!visible||document.visibilityState!=='visible')return;const img=element.querySelector('img');if(requirePhoto&&(!img?.complete||!img.naturalWidth))return;
   timer=setTimeout(()=>{const dialog=document.querySelector('dialog[open]');if(dialog&&!dialog.contains(element)){schedule();return;}if(document.visibilityState==='visible'){done=true;latest.current();observer.disconnect();}},800);};
  const observer=new IntersectionObserver(entries=>{visible=entries[0].isIntersecting&&entries[0].intersectionRatio>=.55;schedule();},{threshold:.55});observer.observe(element);
  document.addEventListener('visibilitychange',schedule);element.addEventListener('load',schedule,true);
  return()=>{clearTimeout(timer);observer.disconnect();document.removeEventListener('visibilitychange',schedule);element.removeEventListener('load',schedule,true);};
 },[ref,key,requirePhoto]);
}
function Gallery({property,onPhoto,detail=false,onOpen}:{property:Property;onPhoto:(index:number)=>void;detail?:boolean;onOpen?:()=>void}){
 const [index,setIndex]=useState(0);useEffect(()=>setIndex(0),[property.id]);
 const gallery=useRef<HTMLDivElement>(null);useVisibleEvent(gallery,`${property.id}:${index}:${property.photos[index]}`,()=>onPhoto(index),true);
 const move=(delta:number)=>{const next=(index+delta+property.photos.length)%property.photos.length;setIndex(next);};
 return <div ref={gallery} className={`photo ${detail?'detail-photo':''}`}>
 {onOpen?<button className="photo-open" onClick={onOpen} aria-label={`View ${property.address}`}><Photo property={property} index={index}/></button>:<Photo property={property} index={index}/>}
 <span className="photo-label">{property.style} <span>·</span> {property.tags[0]}</span>{property.photos.length>0&&<span className="photo-count">{index+1} / {property.photos.length}</span>}
 {property.photos.length>1&&<><button className="photo-arrow prev" onClick={()=>move(-1)} aria-label={`Previous photo of ${property.address}`}><ChevronLeft/></button><button className="photo-arrow next" onClick={()=>move(1)} aria-label={`Next photo of ${property.address}`}><ChevronRight/></button></>}
 {property.photos.length>0&&<span className="photo-credit">{property.listing?.photoCredit||(property.source==='seller'?'Photos provided by seller':'Illustrative photography · Unsplash')}</span>}<div className="photo-dots" aria-hidden="true">{property.photos.map((_,i)=><span key={i} className={i===index?'selected':''}/>)}</div>
 </div>;
}
function Card({recommendation,liked,saved,hidden,onOpen,onAction,onHide,onShare,onInterest,onRestore,nearby=false}:{nearby?:boolean;recommendation:Recommendation;liked:boolean;saved:boolean;hidden:boolean;onOpen:()=>void;onAction:(k:EventKind,index?:number)=>void;onHide:()=>void;onShare:()=>void;onInterest:()=>void;onRestore:()=>void}){
 const ref=useRef<HTMLElement>(null);const latest=useRef(onAction);latest.current=onAction;
 useVisibleEvent(ref,recommendation.property.id,()=>latest.current('impression'));
 const p=recommendation.property; const interest=interestFor(p,researchProperties,[]);
 return <article ref={ref} className="property-card" aria-label={p.address} data-property-id={p.id}>
 <header className="card-top"><span className="listing-mark"><Home size={18}/></span><div><strong>{p.area}</strong><small>Greater Victoria, BC</small></div><span className={`recommendation-badge ${recommendation.discovery?'discovery':''}`}>{recommendation.discovery?<Compass size={13}/>:<Sparkles size={13}/>} {p.source==='imported'?'Imported preview':recommendation.outsideRadius?'Outside your radius':p.source==='seller'?'Seller listed':nearby?'Nearby home':recommendation.discovery?'A little discovery':'Picked for you'}</span></header>
 <Gallery property={p} onOpen={onOpen} onPhoto={i=>onAction('photo',i)}/>
 <div className="card-body"><div className="price-line"><strong className="price">{p.price>0?<>{money(p.price)}<small>CAD</small></>:'Price not set'}</strong><span className="type">{p.type}</span></div><h2><button onClick={onOpen}>{p.address}</button></h2><div className="facts"><span><BedDouble/>{p.beds} beds</span><span><Bath/>{p.baths} baths</span><span><Square/>{p.sqft.toLocaleString()} sq ft</span></div>
 <p className={`match-note ${recommendation.discovery?'discovery-note':''}`}><Sparkles size={14}/>{recommendation.outsideRadius?`${((recommendation.distanceFromCentre||0)/1000).toFixed(2)} km from your search centre · Matches your other preferences.`:recommendation.distanceFromCentre!==undefined?`${(recommendation.distanceFromCentre/1000).toFixed(2)} km from your search centre · Inside your radius${recommendation.tradeoffs.length?` · ${recommendation.tradeoffs.join(' · ')}`:''}`:nearby?`${p.location?.distanceMeters} m from 1920 Crescent Rd · Straight line`:recommendation.discovery?`${p.style} in ${p.area}. ${recommendation.tradeoffs.join(' · ')}.`:`${p.style} · ${p.area} · ${p.beds}+ beds. Feels like your kind of home.`}</p>
 <div className="social"><button aria-label={`${liked?'Unlike':'Like'} ${p.address}`} aria-pressed={liked} className={liked?'active like':''} onClick={()=>onAction(liked?'unlike':'like')}><Heart/> <span>{liked?'Liked':'Like'}</span></button><button aria-label={`${saved?'Unsave':'Save'} ${p.address}`} aria-pressed={saved} className={saved?'active':''} onClick={()=>onAction(saved?'unsave':'save')}><Bookmark/> <span>{saved?'Saved':'Save'}</span></button><button aria-label={`Share ${p.address}`} onClick={onShare}><Share2/><span>Share</span></button>{hidden?<button className="not-for-me" onClick={onRestore}><Undo2/><span>Restore</span></button>:<button className="not-for-me" onClick={onHide} aria-label={`Not for me: ${p.address}`}><MoreHorizontal/><span>Not for me</span></button>}</div>
 <div className="card-footer"><button onClick={onOpen}>Explore this home{p.videos?.length?` · ${p.videos.length} video${p.videos.length===1?'':'s'}`:''} <ArrowRight size={14}/></button><button className={`interest-link ${interest.high?'high-interest':''}`} onClick={onInterest}>{interest.high?<><Flame size={13}/> High Interest</>:<><Info size={13}/> Interest explained</>}</button></div></div></article>;
}
export default function Marketplace(){return <AccountProvider><AccountMarketplace/></AccountProvider>;}
